# B-02 — ILattice micro-benchmark.
# This scenario does NOT use the simulator pipeline. It is a separate harness-driven
# benchmark that exercises ILattice directly (point reads/writes, BulkLoadAsync,
# range scans) bypassing VehicleGrain entirely. benchmark.ps1 prints a pointer to
# the docs page rather than standing up the docker-compose stack — there is no
# server-side topology to bring up because the harness embeds Orleans.TestingHost.
BENCH_DESCRIPTION="ILattice micro-benchmark (harness-only — no docker-compose)"
BENCH_KIND=microbench
BENCH_HARNESS_HINT="dotnet run -c Release --project test/lattice/Orleans.Lattice.Tests.csproj -- --filter LatticeMicroBenchmark"
